  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">MY STORY Motivational Session by Successful Entrepreneur</h2>\n</div>\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n<strong>Organizing Department Name:  Institute Innovation Council (IIC)</strong>\n\n<strong>Title of the event: MY STORY Motivational Session by Successful Entrepreneur</strong>\n\n<strong>Date: 18-12-2020</strong>\n\n<strong>Venue: Through MS Teams</strong>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify;\"><strong>Event Description: </strong>ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized a talk <strong>MY STORY Motivational Session by Successful Entrepreneur</strong> on 18th December 2020 for students and faculties of Higher Educational Institutions (HEIs). Sri Thungaraju G D, Founder- TIECEE and Co-Founder- People Mechanics shared the information about his successful journey as an entrepreneur for both faculty and students of the institutions.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
